{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿赎回不贞之妻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说：“你要再去爱那个另有新欢的淫妇，像耶和华爱以色列人一样爱她。尽管以色列人祭拜其他神明，喜爱葡萄饼，耶和华仍然爱他们。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["于是，我用三两银子和二百公斤大麦赎回她，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["对她说：“你要和我住许多日子。这期间不可行淫，不可亲近别的男人，我也不与你同房。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["以色列人也要有许多日子没有君王和首领，没有祭祀和神柱，也没有以弗得和家庭神像。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["之后，以色列人将回心转意，寻求他们的上帝耶和华，归向他们的君王大卫。在末后的日子，他们将怀着敬畏的心归向耶和华，领受祂的恩惠。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}